      "name": "Dashashwamedh Ghat Visitor Guide",
      "description": "One of Varanasi's best-known riverfront landmarks, Dashashwamedh Ghat brings together pilgrims, boats, and the energy of the old city. It is especially associated with the evening Ganga Aarti, when lamps, bells, and prayers create an unforgettable riverside atmosphere. A daytime visit reveals a different, equally absorbing rhythm of life along the steps.",
